    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19936" root="سفر" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفْرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَافِرٌ</span>, in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A mark,
an impression, a trace,</i> or <i>a vestige,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَثَرٌ</span>, K, TA,)
<i>remaining:</i> (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُفُورٌ</span>. (K.) [Accord. to
Freytag, it occurs in the Deewán El-Hudhaleeyeen as meaning The <i>track,</i> or <i>trace, of a
surge,</i> or <i>torrent.</i>]

